{
  "id": "section-774",
  "title": "对军队文工团到农村、工厂去锻炼的指示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-154.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>154)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　军队文工团只知道军队的事不够，还应知道工人、农民的事。因此也应同地方文工团一样，要到工厂、农村去，特别要到农村去锻炼，去参加四清。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-153.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-155.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
